# Local trees hold generated and private files that a release, cut from `git
# archive`, does not. Nothing here may reach /source (ADR-0281).
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.p8
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.next
**/build
**/.build
**/DerivedData
